{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","林中决斗"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","选择累计造成伤害最高的敌人，将其踢至空旷区域开启决斗。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","蕾米雅选择累计造成伤害最高的敌人，冲刺至目标附近进行飞踢造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，并将目标延直线击退至一个较空旷的区域，随后再次冲刺到目标身前进行第二次飞踢造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，每次飞踢还会眩晕目标2秒，在这个过程中蕾米雅处于霸体状态。落地后与目标开启“决斗”，持续12秒，在此期间双方优先以对方为攻击目标。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":90,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":86,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":127,"end":129,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","飞踢的伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","凌空一击"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","可免疫敌人的普通攻击并反制敌人，还能施展旋风腿造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当受到来自蕾米雅攻击目标的普通攻击伤害时，若目标在自身附近1格范围，则免疫本次伤害并立即踢向目标，造成260% + 25% ATK伤害和2秒眩晕，该效果至多每6秒触发一次，施法期间处于霸体状态。主动释放时，倒立旋转腿部对周围1格范围内的敌人造成3次110% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":92,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":124,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至120% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至125% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至130% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","掠影腿技"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升暴击，当普通攻击暴击时，追加一次超级踢腿造成伤害和眩晕。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","蕾米雅提升15点暴击，每当自身普通攻击暴击时，立即追加一次超级踢腿，造成1秒眩晕和200% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","超级踢腿的伤害提高至210% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","超级踢腿的伤害提高至230% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","超级踢腿的伤害提高至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升20点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","好胜信念"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","强化自身在“决斗”期间的部分属性，并升级“掠影腿技”的效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","蕾米雅在开启“决斗”后激活自身潜能，在“决斗”期间提高55点暴击增幅和15%攻击力，同时“掠影腿技”中的超级踢腿变成无影腿，造成8次伤害，每次70% ATK，眩晕时长提升至2秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","提高60点暴击增幅和18%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“决斗”结束时，比较双方对对方造成的伤害，若自身造成的伤害更高，则视为“决斗”胜利，在“决斗”期间激活的潜能效果将延长8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","提高65点暴击增幅和20%攻击力。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低来自非自身攻击目标的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","降低35%来自非自身攻击目标的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，获得可抵御800% ATK伤害的护盾，护盾存在期间自身获得25点暴击和40点暴击增幅。释放终极技能时额外获得800% ATK的该护盾，且每次决斗胜利后获得300点能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":60,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","逐胜心环"]]}